  dialogueSteps:
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Shocked
    dialogueEN: EHHHHH!!!
    dialogueID: EHHHHH!!!
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Shocked
    dialogueEN: Why did my head suddenly get so dizzy?
    dialogueID: Kenapa tiba-tiba kepalaku pusing banget.
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Shocked
    dialogueEN: The lighthouse too. Why is it like that?
    dialogueID: Mercusuarnya juga. Kenapa kek gitu?
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Questioning
    dialogueEN: Ugh. Am I dizzy from riding the bus earlier?
    dialogueID: Aduh. Apa aku mabuk perkara naik bis tadi?
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Normal
    dialogueEN: I have to get through.
    dialogueID: Aku harus lewat.
